# === 機密：絕對不可進版控 ===
# TDX OAuth2 client credentials
#
# 用萬用字元涵蓋所有變體 —— 「.env copy」「.env 備份.txt」這類檔名
# 用 `.env` / `.env.*` 兩條規則是擋不住的，而它們同樣可能含有金鑰。
*.env
*.env*
.env*
!.env.example
!*/.env.example
secrets/
*.pem
*.p8
*.p12
*.key

# Firebase
GoogleService-Info.plist
.firebase/
firebase-debug.log
serviceAccountKey.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json

# === Xcode ===
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

# Swift Package Manager
.swiftpm/
.build/
Packages/

# CocoaPods / Carthage（若使用）
Pods/
Carthage/Build/

# === Node（Cloud Functions / Cloud Run）===
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# === 靜態資料快取產物 ===
data-cache/
*.json.gz

# === TDX 實測產出（含原始回應樣本，可能量大）===
probe-output/

# === OS ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# === 編輯器 ===
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
